{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21021","headline":"吕将军歌 · 李贺","name":"吕将军歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吕将军，骑赤兔。\n独携大胆出秦门，金粟堆边哭陵树。\n北方逆气污青天，劒龙夜呌将军闲。\n将军振袖挥劒锷，玉阙朱城有门阁。\n榼榼银龟摇白马，傅粉女郎火旗下。\n恒山铁骑请金枪，遥闻箙中花箭香。\n西郊寒蓬叶如刺，皇天新栽养神骥。\n廐中高桁排蹇蹄，饱食青刍饮白水。\n圆苍低迷盖张地，九州人事皆如此。\n赤山秀铤御时英，绿眼将军会天意。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}